<http://data.silknow.org/object/38d39798-81fe-3f59-9966-651786114cbd>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Mitre of crimson and gold silk velvet. With a gothic diaper pattern. Cut pile-on-pile crimson silk velvet enriched with gold loops and gold thread. Bands of cut and uncut polychrome silk velvet enriched with silver-gilt thread and loops. Trimmed with a plaited braid of silk and silver-gilt thread and a silk fringe. Lined with silk."@en , "The mitre is a head-piece worn by bishops and archbishops for Christian church ceremonies. This example shows the use of luxury materials too expensive to waste,  so velvets of two different dates have been joined to make up the mitre. The main part of the top and the lappets--the hanging tails--are made of a luxurious silk velvet enriched with silver-gilt thread, including loops, also called 'cloth of gold' velvet."@en , "Mitre of silk velvet, Italy, 15th century-early 16th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/ba7c6d22-cecb-37a0-8242-70a85ff4df40> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "The mitre is a head-piece worn by bishops and archbishops for Christian church ceremonies. This example shows the use of luxury materials too expensive to waste,  so velvets of two different dates have been joined to make up the mitre. The main part of the top and the lappets--the hanging tails--are made of a luxurious silk velvet enriched with silver-gilt thread, including loops, also called 'cloth of gold' velvet."@en , "Mitre of crimson and gold silk velvet. With a gothic diaper pattern. Cut pile-on-pile crimson silk velvet enriched with gold loops and gold thread. Bands of cut and uncut polychrome silk velvet enriched with silver-gilt thread and loops. Trimmed with a plaited braid of silk and silver-gilt thread and a silk fringe. Lined with silk."@en , "Mitre of silk velvet, Italy, 15th century-early 16th century"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/38d39798-81fe-3f59-9966-651786114cbd/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/38d39798-81fe-3f59-9966-651786114cbd/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/38d39798-81fe-3f59-9966-651786114cbd/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/38d39798-81fe-3f59-9966-651786114cbd/dimension/1> ;
